    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short horror game where you try to escape from a bathroom using a point-and-click interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange phenomena in a restroom that should be empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A teacher who never comes out from the neighboring stall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items that shouldn\u2019t be there appear in the restroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the terrifying experience of facing eerie situations in a bathroom with no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses mainly through movies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly immersive 360\u00b0 exploration scene</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to return to branching scenes from the scenario chart.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/list]</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short horror game where you try to escape from a bathroom using a point-and-click interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange phenomena in a restroom that should be empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A teacher who never comes out from the neighboring stall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items that shouldn\u2019t be there appear in the restroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the terrifying experience of facing eerie situations in a bathroom with no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses mainly through movies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly immersive 360\u00b0 exploration scene</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to return to branching scenes from the scenario chart.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/list]</p>",
